  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Us Foods obligated $216M in federal contracts in FY2026 to date. Us Foods won 77 awards this fiscal year, with an average award size of $2.8M. Us Foods' obligations fell 15.3% year over year. Department of Veterans Affairs is the largest buyer of Us Foods in FY2026 to date, with obligations of $170M. Department of Defense obligated $32.8M from Us Foods. Other agencies buying from Us Foods in FY2026 to date include the Department of Agriculture ($7.5M), the Department of the Interior ($3.3M), the Department of the Treasury ($1.4M), and the Department of Health and Human Services ($1.3M). All Other Miscellaneous Food Manufacturing is Us Foods' top NAICS market with $216M obligated in FY2026 to date. Us Foods also has obligations in Perishable Prepared Food Manufacturing ($276K) and in Food Service Contractors ($10.9K). FY2026 totals are partial because the fiscal year is still in progress.",
